      "title": "Proving Grounds bouts are an uncapped scrap/loot faucet (not in the daily loop, but live in the build)",
      "detail": "begin_bout fights a CLONE (combat_screen.gd:126-135) so a bout risks at most one broken bench bit, pays loot on WIN (any non-core foe part) and pays YOU salvage on a survivable-loss forfeit (combat_screen.gd:1149-1153). At the lane's boss prior 0.5, a Brassmore bout EV is >= 0.5*45 = 22.5 scrap (EPIC loot melted) per bout with zero entry cost and no daily cap - it dominates the kit purse cap (max 10+25+40=75/run, halving to 37 after 2 runs). Recommend a bout stake (entry fee) or a daily bout purse cap before launch."
    },
