      "detail": "EPIC Find costs 10 glimmer (broker.gd:25) and melts for 45 scrap (broker.gd:11) = 4.5 scrap/glimmer; RARE Find 4 -> 20 = 5.0. The reverse channel (brass coffer 100 scrap -> EV 2.30 glimmer via the Still = 43.5 scrap/glimmer) is 8-10x more expensive, so there is NO profitable round trip (100 scrap -> 2.30 glimmer -> ~10.3 scrap), but the 'no conversion' design claim is not literally true."
